Subject: [PATCH 434/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0433: show the
 approval message toggle only when the clamped text overflows

AeClampedMessage always clamps to three lines while collapsed and shows the toggle only when scrollHeight exceeds clientHeight (measured on layout and on resize). Whitespace handling is the same open and closed and trailing newlines are trimmed. The toggle is 24px tall with a focus ring and no aria-expanded or aria-controls, since the full text stays readable to a screen reader. A new message folds again.
